sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CR as Scheduler/Cron
    participant LJ as LeaderboardRebuildJob
    participant MR as Metrics Repository
    participant US as Usage Service
    participant RZ as Shared Redis Cache
    participant EB as Event Bus
    participant L as Logger

    Note over CR,LJ: Recompute leaderboards for a window and metric

    CR->>LJ: triggerRebuild(orgId, metric, from, to, scope=global|team)
    LJ->>L: log("start", orgId, metric, from, to, scope)

    alt metric in [score, sessions]
        LJ->>MR: fetchRankInputs(orgId, scope, from, to, metric)
        MR-->>LJ: rows[{subjectId, value, lastActivity}]
    else metric in [tokens, calls]
        LJ->>US: fetchUsageRankInputs(orgId, scope, from, to, metric)
        US-->>LJ: rows[{subjectId, value, lastActivity}]
    end

    Note over LJ: sort by value desc, tie-break lastActivity desc then subjectId asc

    LJ->>MR: writeLeaderboard(orgId, scope, metric, from, to, rows)
    MR-->>LJ: ok

    LJ->>RZ: DEL cache["lb_global", orgId, metric, *]
    LJ->>RZ: DEL cache["lb_team", *, metric, *]

    LJ->>EB: publish("leaderboard.rebuilt", {orgId, scope, metric, from, to})
    EB-->>LJ: ack

    LJ->>L: log("done", counts=rows.length)
